ink":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/305-kergonan","name":"Kergonan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar305_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-15T01:15:28-08:00","id":1017537,"title":"","content":"I'm a bit wary. I mean, this is an Onyx Path forum, if you go to the trouble to register you're probably already pretty heavily invested in CoD. Yeah, I'd back a kickstarter on day one but that's not exactly news.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-21T10:40:40-08:00","id":1020487,"title":"","content":"Hunter isn't the highest game on my list to play, but I'd be interested in backing the Kickstarter. If nothing else, Hunters serve to connect the other supernaturals to humanity more innately than even their onw histories can, if through a double barrel shotgun. Hunters embody the fear of the Other, which is by and large lost when one becomes that Other - they just are more proactive about it than the average person is. I love that concept, among others that Hunters represent, and that's why I'd back the kickstarter as soon as I could.<br /> <br /> Fortunately, we do have Mortal Remains to tide us over, but for the other supplements, I agree, we need an update.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"r